{'symbol': 'TRGP', 'date': '2023-04-04 16:10:00', 'title': 'TARGA RESOURCES CORP. TO PARTICIPATE IN J.P. MORGAN MIDWEST UTILITIES & MIDSTREAM 1X1 FORUM', 'text': 'HOUSTON, APRIL 04, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TARGA RESOURCES CORP. (NYSE: TRGP) ("TARGA" OR THE "COMPANY") ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT REPRESENTATIVES FROM THE COMPANY WILL PARTICIPATE IN INVESTOR MEETINGS AT THE J.P. MORGAN MIDWEST UTILITIES & MIDSTREAM 1X1 FORUM ON THURSDAY, APRIL 6, 2023 IN CHICAGO, IL.'}